WEBVTT

00:00:12.526 --> 00:00:14.922
<v><b>M:</b></v> So Ben, what do you do?

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.333
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m a student.

00:00:19.135 --> 00:00:19.828
<v><b>M:</b></v> Nice.

00:00:20.255 --> 00:00:21.067
What do you study?

00:00:25.781 --> 00:00:26.948
<v><b>I:</b></v> He studies photography.

00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:30.802
His photos are amazing!

00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:32.458
<v><b>M:</b></v> Cool.

00:00:32.953 --> 00:00:35.156
Maybe you can work for us in a few years.

00:00:37.297 --> 00:00:40.229
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, maybe.

00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:48.229
<v><b>I:</b></v> Ben’s very artistic.

00:00:48.745 --> 00:00:50.990
<v><b>M:</b></v> Artistic? That’s great.

00:00:51.724 --> 00:00:53.740
Do you have a real job?

00:00:58.776 --> 00:00:59.797
<v><b>B:</b></v> A real job?

00:01:00.214 --> 00:01:00.646
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:03.063
Do you have a job with a salary?

00:01:04.391 --> 00:01:04.823
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:09.172
Um… Well, I work at a café.

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:11.031
<v><b>M:</b></v> Perfect.

00:01:11.786 --> 00:01:16.130
If you can’t earn enough money as a photographer, people always need coffee.

00:01:21.286 --> 00:01:21.692
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:23.808
I guess you’re right.

00:01:26.781 --> 00:01:27.437
<v><b>W:</b></v> Here you are.

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:28.828
Sorry about the mistake.

00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:34.172
<v><b>M:</b></v> Oh, don’t worry Ben, I’ve got this.

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:53.000
<v><b>E:</b></v> How was your evening?

00:01:54.568 --> 00:01:56.084
<v><b>B:</b></v> I didn’t enjoy it much.

00:01:57.724 --> 00:01:58.792
<v><b>E:</b></v> Are you still out with them?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:04.584
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, they all went to have a drink.

00:02:06.719 --> 00:02:14.813
I didn’t want to go, so I said I was tired… I really don’t like these people.

00:02:16.104 --> 00:02:18.458
They’re too… confident for me.

00:02:19.609 --> 00:02:22.080
<v><b>E:</b></v> There’s nothing wrong with being confident, Ben.

00:02:22.714 --> 00:02:26.276
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, they’re just a bit fake, that’s all.

00:02:27.531 --> 00:02:28.651
<v><b>E:</b></v> Did Izzy go with them?

00:02:29.953 --> 00:02:30.396
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:02:31.661 --> 00:02:33.468
<v><b>E:</b></v> She likes these people, right?

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:35.208
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:02:36.776 --> 00:02:37.385
She does.

00:02:39.026 --> 00:02:43.177
She’s… changing.

00:02:44.224 --> 00:02:47.073
<v><b>E:</b></v> Things change, Ben, and people change too.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.302
That’s life.